      "knowledge_id": "unirank-method-infnet",
      "decision": "used",
      "rationale": "Read current card, fallback benchmark text and pinned forward; host task-mask aggregation is a concrete component adopted as input-only sufficient statistics. Archived r0006 residual failures do not evaluate INFNet itself. Original primary INFNet text is unavailable, so implementation-level provenance is the limit.",
      "transformed_mechanism": "Replace feedback-mask means of learned event embeddings and repeated hubs by channel-specific target category/brand match log-counts/fractions with task-specific additive logit weights.",
      "variant_names": [
        "feedback_match_evidence",
        "collapsed_feedback_matches",
        "feedback_availability_control",
        "collapsed_availability_control"
      ],
      "nearest_work_difference": "No categorical/task hubs, projected feedback embeddings, hub broadcast or iterative interaction is implemented. The local factorial tests target binding and feedback identity within the new deterministic readout.",
      "falsifier": "If erasing feedback identity is equally good, resolved aggregation is not supported here; a gain shared by all cells cannot validate INFNet or repeated hub exchange.",
